# beatmania IIDX 3rd style (GC992 VER. JAB), Konami 2000: as bmiidx3-play.his.
# beatmania IIDX 3rd style (Twinkle): a scripted game from the NVRAM bmiidx3-boot leaves
# (backup RAM cleared). Two coins in the device check (counted), 1P Start on the title, a key
# at mode select (7KEYS) and at sound select, then the first stage played with a fixed
# pattern: the seven keys in turn and turntable spins in both directions, to the result.
# Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames, against MAME (PLAN.md 21, TW-2).
game bmiidx3b

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 1800 press "Coin 1" 8
at 1830 press "Coin 1" 8
at 2700 press "1 Player Start" 8
at 3000 press "P1-1 (SW1)" 8       # mode select: 7KEYS
at 3600 press "P1-1 (SW1)" 8       # sound select: the song under the cursor
# the stage: a key every 9 frames, 1 to 7 in turn; a turntable spin every 120 frames, 16 frames
# of 6 steps a frame, alternating direction
at 4000 press "P1-1 (SW1)" 4
at 4009 press "P1-2 (SW2)" 4
at 4018 press "P1-3 (SW3)" 4
at 4027 press "P1-4 (SW4)" 4
at 4036 press "P1-5 (SW5)" 4
at 4045 press "P1-6 (SW6)" 4
at 4054 press "P1-7 (SW7)" 4
